<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Skåla from Tjugen — Tjugen–Skåla return</name><desc>Climb from Tjugen through forest beside Fossdøla, cross the bridge and continue past Skålavatnet on the marked summer path and stone steps to Skålabu and Skålatårnet. Return by the same steep path. Attempt only in stable snow-free conditions; check the dated autumn snow warning and current operator advice.

